#: alternate_emulators.py:434
msgid ""
"Add the ROM files in the ROM folder that have one of the valid extensions.  "
"Existing entries and their names are kept.  Not available when the ROM "
"folder is 'Default', as that would add every MAME ROM to this emulator."
msgstr ""
"在 ROM 文件夹中添加具有有效扩展名之一的 ROM 文件。  现有条目及其名称将被保留。  当 ROM 文件夹为“默认”时不可用，因为这会将每个 "
"MAME ROM 添加到此模拟器。"

